## Session Management (Two-Command Handoff)

Windsurf Cascade does not persist context across sessions.

**End session:** Reference `@.plobi-prompts/package.md` — AI reads state, writes `.ai/SESSION.md`.

**Start session:** Reference `@.plobi-prompts/resume.md` — AI reads `.ai/SESSION.md` → `.ai/SESSION_TEMPLATES.md` → generates complete opening.

